This service loads external components at runtime, each under its own license:

  transcribe.cpp          MIT (https://github.com/handy-computer/transcribe.cpp)
  IBM Granite Speech 5.0  CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 for the "-nc" checkpoint,
                          Apache-2.0 for the standard checkpoint
                          (https://huggingface.co/ibm-granite/granite-speech-5.0-470m-turboctc)

Note that the "-nc" Granite checkpoint is NOT licensed for commercial use.
Pick the Apache-2.0 checkpoint if you intend to use this commercially.
